      "authorType": "TOPIC",
      "competitionRanking": 138,
      "content": "<p>The following is written for the Open Progress Prize:</p>\n<p><strong>Open Progress Prize: $5,000 + 1 DGX Sparks</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Awarded to the team with the highest leaderboard score as of the Midpoint Cut-off Date: April 9, 2026.</li>\n<li>Methodology submissions Cut-off Date: April 16, 2026.</li>\n<li>Winners will be announced during Cloud NEXT (April 22-24, 2026)</li>\n<li>Each eligible participant may receive no more than one (1) DGX Spark.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Because many participants may want to form teams to compete for this prize, **will each member of a team receive 1 DGX Sparks? **</p>\n<p>The question is crucial because 1 DGX Spark cannot be shared among different members of a team.</p>",
      "feedbackTrackingData": {},
      "id": 3433884,
      "isThankYou": false,
      "kernelVersion": 0,
      "parent": {},
      "postDate": "2026-04-02T09:08:43.493Z",
      "rawMarkdown": "The following is written for the Open Progress Prize:\n\n**Open Progress Prize: $5,000 + 1 DGX Sparks**\n\n- Awarded to the team with the highest leaderboard score as of the Midpoint Cut-off Date: April 9, 2026.\n- Methodology submissions Cut-off Date: April 16, 2026.\n- Winners will be announced during Cloud NEXT (April 22-24, 2026)\n- Each eligible participant may receive no more than one (1) DGX Spark.\n\nBecause many participants may want to form teams to compete for this prize, **will each member of a team receive 1 DGX Sparks? **\n\nThe question is crucial because 1 DGX Spark cannot be shared among different members of a team.",
